🐛 Describe the bug
This causes #86059
Autocast cache is thread local:
using weakref_type = c10::weak_intrusive_ptr<TensorImpl, UndefinedTensorImpl>;
using val_type = std::tuple<weakref_type, Tensor>;
thread_local std::unordered_map<TensorImpl*, val_type> cached_casts;

Clearing it only clears the local cache
void clear_cache() {
  cached_casts.clear();
}

This means if other threads (e.g., autograd backwards triggering an autocast) stash into the cache you will permanently leak. We should fix this, probably by making the cache global (and synchronizing it)
